{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17101","headline":"使院忆山中道侣兼怀李约 · 崔备","name":"使院忆山中道侣兼怀李约","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松竹去名岳，衡茅思旧居。\n山君水上印，天女月中书。\n旧秩芸香在，空匳药气余。\n褐衣宽易揽，白发少难梳。\n病柳伤摧折，残花惜扫除。\n忆巢同倦鸟，避网甚跳鱼。\n阮巷惭交绝，商嵓愧迹疎。\n与君非宦侣，何日共樵渔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔备","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17101.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17101","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}